Status-ID mapping: packet[1] carries the rotating index in its lower 7 bits plus protocol flags; live frames arrive as 0x80-0xB6. Masking with 0x7F fixes IDs >= 0x80 (0x85 -> index 5 -> flashReadAddr[5]=0x0C battery calibration, not 0xE2 speed). flashReadAddr table is identical to upstream fardriver_message.hpp. ControllerNotifier stores every decoded field (speed/power/batt%/temps/gear) into ControllerState per frame, so the dashboard refreshes immediately; 221 tests pass, dart format clean, analyze has only pre-existing non-fatal infos.
